# Written by hand for peugeot.obj, whose own .mtl was not distributed with it.
# The material NAMES come from the OBJ's usemtl lines; the values are chosen to
# look right, not measured from anything.
#
# Ns is the specular exponent - bigger means a smaller, tighter highlight.
# Only Tyre and the brake disks carry texture coordinates, so map_Kd is only
# useful on those; every other material relies on Kd alone.

newmtl Body(Black)
Kd 0.030 0.030 0.035
Ks 0.900 0.900 0.900
Ns 220

newmtl Body(Gold)
Kd 0.720 0.550 0.180
Ks 1.000 0.950 0.800
Ns 250

newmtl Black
Kd 0.020 0.020 0.020
Ks 0.200 0.200 0.200
Ns 40

